==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

  - Take of battery lid (no battery support for this model, battery cage is dummy). Some models don't have a battery lid in which case skip this step.
  - Unscrew screw placed behind battery lid. Skip if no battery lid.
  - Take off back cover. It attached with multiple plastic clamps.
  - Unscrew four more screws hidden behind back case.
  - Remove front panel from blue chassis. There are more plastic clamps.
  - Unscrew two screws, which secures the PCB in the chassis.
  - Extract board from blue chassis.

