==== Internal Modem ====

The internal modem is a Cat.12 LTE device based on Qualcomm's MDM9250 chipset. It supports up to 3xCA for download and up to 2xCA for upload in B12 FW version (firmware dependant).

The modem is installed in a mPCIe slot and could potentially be removed or replaced.

Supported LTE bands: B1 B3 B7 B8 B20 B28 B32 B38 (that may vary depending on the modem firmware version used)
